    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOLyTYAM7BAfI1",
      "title": "docs: design doc for migrating to SuperDisputeGame",
      "author": "stevennevins",
      "number": 365,
      "body": "  **Description**                                                                                                                  \r\n                                                                                                                                   \r\n  Design for migrating existing single-chain dispute games (FaultDisputeGame/PermissionedDisputeGame) to SuperDisputeGame as a \r\n  prerequisite for interop.                                                                                                        \r\n                                                                                                                                   \r\n  Key updates:                                                                                                                      \r\n  - Change 1: Update OptimismPortal2 with `_isSuperGameType()` helper to separate new code path in proveWithdrawalTransaction from the backward compatible path\r\n  - Change 2: OPCM v2 `upgrade()` deploys SDG and switches game type atomically\r\n  - Existing withdrawals stay valid via `wasRespectedGameTypeWhenCreated` flag                                                     \r\n                                                                                                                                   \r\n  **Tests**                                                                                                                        \r\n                                                                                                                                   \r\n  N/A - design doc only.                                                                                                           \r\n                                                                                                                                   \r\n  **Additional context**                                                                                                           \r\n                                                                                                                                   \r\n  This enables use to progress toward interoperability via:\r\n  Step 1 of interop: individual chains migrate to Super Games. \r\n  Step 2 (future) allows interop sets to share a single SuperDisputeGame.                                                                                                         \r\n                                                                                                                                   \r\n  Related docs:                                                                                                                    \r\n  - [OPCM v2 Design Doc](protocol/opcm-v2.md)                                                                                      \r\n  - [FMA: SuperDisputeGame Migration](security/fma-super-dispute-game-migration.md)                                                \r\n                                                                                                                                   \r\n  **Metadata**                                                                                                                     \r\n                                                                                                                                   \r\n  - Fixes ethereum-optimism/optimism#19007",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/design-docs",
      "createdAt": "2026-02-02T20:36:42Z",
